{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2022-04-07 14:42:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN WATER AND NEW JERSEY AMERICAN WATER RECOGNIZED BY PHILADELPHIA BUSINESS JOURNAL WITH 2022 FACES OF PHILANTHROPY AWARD', 'text': 'CAMDEN, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN WATER (NYSE: AWK), THE LARGEST PUBLICLY TRADED U.S. WATER AND WASTEWATER UTILITY COMPANY, ALONG WITH NEW JERSEY AMERICAN WATER WERE RECOGNIZED TODAY BY THE PHILADELPHIA BUSINESS JOURNAL AS ONE OF THE 2022 FACES OF PHILANTHROPY FOR MAKING A DIFFERENCE IN THE GREATER PHILADELPHIA REGION THROUGH ITS UNIQUE AND HIGHLY SUCCESSFUL PARTNERSHIP WITH HOPEWORKS. AMERICAN WATER AND NEW JERSEY AMERICAN WATER HAVE A LONG-STANDING COLLABORATION WITH HOPEWORKS, A NON-PR'}